step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Evaluate trimmed_mean over the full pool to see if trimming improves over median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test the best_single strategy using ARIMA to see if a single top model outperforms the trimmed_mean pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the moderately stable pool2 to see if median outperforms trimmed_mean and best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the small, stable pool1 to see if a simple robust estimator beats the best_single ARIMA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Try a DTW barycenter on the most stable pool3 to see if it can beat trimmed_mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test median over pool3 to see if a robust estimator on the stable subset beats the current best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter on the most stable subset (pool1) to see if a more sophisticated combination beats the current best single ARIMA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter on the more stable pool2 to see if a different aggregation improves over trimmed_mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse-error weights on the full pool to see if simple inverse-error weighting improves over best_single ARIMA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean with a slightly higher trim on the stable pool3 to see if more aggressive trimming improves over the current best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool3","trim_pct":0.3}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the existing handle w1 to see if learned weights beat the best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","weights":"w1","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","rf","DWT_catboost","FT_catboost"]}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if it beats the current weighted best.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

